@host = http://localhost:5126
@token = <pega aquí el accessToken del login>

### Salud (lo usa la Raspberry Pi)
GET {{host}}/health

### Registro
POST {{host}}/api/auth/registro
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nombre": "Diego", "email": "diego@example.com", "password": "contrasena123" }

### Login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "diego@example.com", "password": "contrasena123" }

### Mis alimentadores
GET {{host}}/api/alimentadores
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Dar de alta la Raspberry Pi (la clave solo se muestra aquí)
POST {{host}}/api/gateways
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "deviceId": "pi-casa" }

### Crear alimentador
POST {{host}}/api/alimentadores
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "codigo": "feeder01", "nombre": "Cocina", "kcalPorGramo": 3.6, "gatewayDeviceId": "pi-casa", "zonaHoraria": "America/Mexico_City" }

### Ligar el alimentador a otra Pi propia (Dueño y propietario de la Pi)
PUT {{host}}/api/alimentadores/1/gateway
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "gatewayId": 2 }

### Quitar la Pi del alimentador
DELETE {{host}}/api/alimentadores/1/gateway
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Registrar mascota
POST {{host}}/api/alimentadores/1/mascotas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nombre": "Michi", "especie": "Gato", "pesoKg": 4.2, "edadMeses": 36, "nivelActividad": "Moderado", "esterilizado": true, "comidasPorDia": 3, "etiquetaRfid": null }

### Dispensado manual
POST {{host}}/api/alimentadores/1/dispensar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "gramos": 20, "mascotaId": 1 }

### Dispensado manual sin elegir mascota (1 perro, 2 gato)
POST {{host}}/api/alimentadores/1/dispensar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "gramos": 20, "tolva": 2 }

### Artefactos OTA disponibles
GET {{host}}/api/ota/artefactos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Publicar firmware (solo correos en Ota:Administradores; tipo: firmware | modelo)
POST {{host}}/api/ota/artefactos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=LimiteOta

--LimiteOta
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="tipo"

firmware
--LimiteOta
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="version"

1.3.0
--LimiteOta
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="archivo"; filename="alimentador.bin"
Content-Type: application/octet-stream

< ./ota/alimentador.bin
--LimiteOta--

### Borrar un artefacto que no se haya usado
DELETE {{host}}/api/ota/artefactos/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Lanzar la actualización en un alimentador (solo Dueño)
POST {{host}}/api/alimentadores/1/ota
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "artefactoId": 1 }

### [Pi] Configuración
GET {{host}}/api/device/config?version=0
X-Device-Id: pi-casa
X-Device-Key: <clave del gateway>

### [Pi] Heartbeat al recuperar internet (offlineSince solo en el primero)
POST {{host}}/api/device/heartbeat
X-Device-Id: pi-casa
X-Device-Key: <clave del gateway>
Content-Type: application/json

{ "offlineSince": 1761832800, "feeders": [
  { "feederId": "feeder01", "online": true, "hopperDogPct": 80, "hopperCatPct": 17, "plateDogG": 0, "plateCatG": 5,
    "firmware": "1.0.0", "model": "1", "reportedAt": 1761833400 } ] }

### [Pi] Lote de visitas
POST {{host}}/api/device/visits
X-Device-Id: pi-casa
X-Device-Key: <clave del gateway>
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "feederId": "feeder01", "eventId": "boot42-0007", "petId": 1, "class": "gato", "confidence": 0.93,
    "startedAt": 1761832800, "endedAt": 1761833100, "plateBeforeG": 3.1, "dispensedG": 31.2, "plateAfterG": 5.0 }
]

### [Pi] Evento de tolva baja (hopper: 1 perro, 2 gato)
POST {{host}}/api/device/events
X-Device-Id: pi-casa
X-Device-Key: <clave del gateway>
Content-Type: application/json

[ { "feederId": "feeder01", "eventId": "boot42-0009", "type": "HOPPER_LOW", "occurredAt": 1761833260, "detail": "17", "hopper": 2 } ]

### [Pi] Terminó de vaciar la cola
POST {{host}}/api/device/sync-complete
X-Device-Id: pi-casa
X-Device-Key: <clave del gateway>

### [Pi] Comandos pendientes (OTA trae url, sha256, target y version)
GET {{host}}/api/device/commands
X-Device-Id: pi-casa
X-Device-Key: <clave del gateway>

### [Pi] Resultado de una OTA
POST {{host}}/api/device/commands/1/result
X-Device-Id: pi-casa
X-Device-Key: <clave del gateway>
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ok": true, "dispensedG": null, "error": null }
